{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/e8d292efc0a13cdbece054a6f127c7e1.poster.avif?t=1768654487\" width=800 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/e8d292efc0a13cdbece054a6f127c7e1.webm?t=1768654487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/e8d292efc0a13cdbece054a6f127c7e1.mp4?t=1768654487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timber Trail</strong> is a 3D horror game with a unique pixel-inspired look, set in a vast, mysterious forest. Determined to uncover the truth behind your grandfather\u2019s disappearance years ago, you venture out to discover whether the tales are real or nothing more than local folklore. It doesn\u2019t take long to realize the truth. This is no mere story, and escaping becomes your only priority.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/b70784d1c0dc760fcf0fa007c0fd271c.poster.avif?t=1768654487\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/b70784d1c0dc760fcf0fa007c0fd271c.webm?t=1768654487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/b70784d1c0dc760fcf0fa007c0fd271c.mp4?t=1768654487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>Timber Trail</strong> from a first-person perspective. Explore your surroundings, interact with characters and objects, or simply enjoy the view. But when you wake up in a house, chained to a wall with no memory of how you got there, your naive little research turns into an escape-room\u2013like experience. And of course, Timber Trail has its fair share of jump scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/4ed2b4c36b8cd9b2675771dd0f7fd8de.poster.avif?t=1768654487\" width=1170 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/4ed2b4c36b8cd9b2675771dd0f7fd8de.webm?t=1768654487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/4ed2b4c36b8cd9b2675771dd0f7fd8de.mp4?t=1768654487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you can expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear, story-driven experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique 3D pixel-inspired visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutscenes, dialogue &amp; interactable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3796220?t=1768654487","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/f38ec10a0d2b6a031fe1d12ea1126ff825d8229a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768654487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/fe5734e479a49880d58f6bc9276ee5bca637d591/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768654487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/fe5734e479a49880d58f6bc9276ee5bca637d591/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768654487","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mild horror, jump scares, and creepy scenes. No sexual content. Recommended for players who enjoy horror; not suitable for sensitive viewers."},"demos":[{"appid":4094840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/e8d292efc0a13cdbece054a6f127c7e1.poster.avif?t=1768654487\" width=800 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/e8d292efc0a13cdbece054a6f127c7e1.webm?t=1768654487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/e8d292efc0a13cdbece054a6f127c7e1.mp4?t=1768654487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timber Trail</strong> is a 3D horror game with a unique pixel-inspired look, set in a vast, mysterious forest. Determined to uncover the truth behind your grandfather\u2019s disappearance years ago, you venture out to discover whether the tales are real or nothing more than local folklore. It doesn\u2019t take long to realize the truth. This is no mere story, and escaping becomes your only priority.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/b70784d1c0dc760fcf0fa007c0fd271c.poster.avif?t=1768654487\" width=1170 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/b70784d1c0dc760fcf0fa007c0fd271c.webm?t=1768654487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/b70784d1c0dc760fcf0fa007c0fd271c.mp4?t=1768654487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>Timber Trail</strong> from a first-person perspective. Explore your surroundings, interact with characters and objects, or simply enjoy the view. But when you wake up in a house, chained to a wall with no memory of how you got there, your naive little research turns into an escape-room\u2013like experience. And of course, Timber Trail has its fair share of jump scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/4ed2b4c36b8cd9b2675771dd0f7fd8de.poster.avif?t=1768654487\" width=1170 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/4ed2b4c36b8cd9b2675771dd0f7fd8de.webm?t=1768654487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796220/extras/4ed2b4c36b8cd9b2675771dd0f7fd8de.mp4?t=1768654487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you can expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear, story-driven experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph